# THE SHIP'S RAIL (Entities/Game/shipRail.pre): one piece of the ship's wall along one edge of a 2 m deck tile, 1 m
# tall, 0.4 m thick. Centred meshes (the prefab moves them to the tile's edge): RailX runs along X, RailZ along Z.
# RailSill: the tile's plate under the rail (5 cm over the deck; the structure's own mesh - the units find a structure
# by its mesh). GangwayStep: one step of the stairs out of an entrance tile (gangwayStep.pre): 0.5 m deep (along X), 2 m wide,
# its top at the origin and 1 m deep under it. Hand-written boxes: 1 +X  2 -X  3 +Y  4 -Y  5 +Z  6 -Z
